  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wealth Accounting and Valuation of Ecosystem Services Multi Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The Global Partnership Program on Wealth Accounting and Valuation of Ecosystem Services (WAVES), FY12-FY16,  aims to promote sustainable development worldwide through environmental accounts  which reflect values of  ecosystem services that are incorporated into national  income and comprehensive wealth accounting and that generate better information for decision-making including measuring the attainment of MDG 7 on &quot;&quot;environmental sustainability.&quot;&quot;  The specific objectives are:
 
 1.  To implement ecosystem accounting at national or sub-national level in several developing and developed countries;
 
 2. To incorporate natural capital accounting in policy analysis and development planning;
 
 3.  To develop guidelines for implementing ecosystem accounting for global implementation; and,
 
 4. To promote the adoption of ecosystem and natural capital accounting beyond the WAVES partner countries.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
